stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> INITIATED: signal Δw ≥ Δw_debate
    INITIATED --> ROUND_1: spawn N reasoners
    ROUND_1 --> ROUND_2: no consensus
    ROUND_2 --> ROUND_3: no consensus
    ROUND_1 --> CONCLUDED: consensus ≥ 0.6
    ROUND_2 --> CONCLUDED: consensus ≥ 0.6
    ROUND_3 --> CONCLUDED: consensus ≥ 0.6 OR max rounds
    ROUND_1 --> TIMEOUT: τ_LLM exceeded
    ROUND_2 --> TIMEOUT: τ_LLM exceeded
    ROUND_3 --> TIMEOUT: τ_LLM exceeded
    INITIATED --> ERRORED: provider failure
    ROUND_1 --> ERRORED: provider failure
    CONCLUDED --> [*]: emit DEBATE_CONCLUSION
    TIMEOUT --> [*]: default REJECT
    ERRORED --> [*]: default REJECT + alert
